      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, locking photo sharing behind VRC+ is one thing but making it so the recipient also needs VRC+ means photo sharing has way less utility than it could. Changing the pedestals so they use a screenspace shader ball would fix this, others could just stick their camera in and take a screenshot of the shared photo. The current design of the pedestal would already work well for this implementation since it already resembles a screenspace ball.",
