  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Because of non VRC+ users doesnt have gallary, they cannot copy and display shared images.\n\nBut I want to share my capturing moment everyone, not only VRC+ users.\n\nI think its breaks \"create, share, play\", so I want some way to share.\n\nMy suggestion is very simple, Add a function zooming image in pedestal.",
